        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Small-type note under the miscellaneous taxes: this cash comes to 133.861 koku of rice. The printed rate reads 8 ryo 9 bu per koku, but the figure was actually computed at 8 per koku (1,070.8955 divided by 8 = 133.8619), and the parenthetical three-item total below confirms 133.86."
